      <link>https://www.peninsulaclarion.com/2026/02/27/ferry-system-crew-shortage-continues-into-its-8th-year/</link>
      <description>The Alaska Marine Highway System has been struggling with less than full staffing since 2019, with last month’s numbers showing the state ferries were short 59 workers to fill jobs as masters, mates, engineers, seaman and stewards.</description>
